  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] __Shortcut Trick__\n\nExpression: √(1764/2025) × √(625/441) − (3/4)−²\n\nWe know that 42² = 1764, 45² = 2025, 25² = 625, and 21² = 441.\n\n⇒ (42/45) × (25/21) − (4/3)²\n\n⇒ 2 × (5/9) − 16/9\n\n⇒ 10/9 − 16/9 = −6/9 = −2/3\n\n**∴ The correct answer is −2/3.**",
